<body>
    <h1>Handling Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h2 id=3D"HandlingPrivacyPolicy-Subject">Subject</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<p>App / Third-party SDK may need to provide <code>Privacy Manifest files</=
code>, if:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>it uses SDKs in the <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://developer=
.apple.com/support/third-party-SDK-requirements/#:~:text=3Dinclude%20the%20=
privacy%20manifest%20for%20any%20SDK%20listed%20below" rel=3D"nofollow">lis=
t</a></p></li>
<li>
<p>it uses <code>Required Reason APIs</code></p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Third-party SDKs need to provide their own privacy manifest files. Our a=
pp=E2=80=99s privacy manifest file doesn=E2=80=99t need to cover data colle=
cted by third-party SDKs that our app links to. [<a class=3D"external-link"=
 href=3D"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/privacy_=
manifest_files/describing_data_use_in_privacy_manifests#:~:text=3DThird%2Dp=
arty%20SDKs%20need%20to%20provide%20their%20own%20privacy%20manifest%20file=
s%20that%20record%20the%20types%20of%20data%20they%20collect.%20Your%20app%=
E2%80%99s%20privacy%20manifest%20file%20doesn%E2%80%99t%20need%20to%20cover=
%20data%20collected%20by%20third%2Dparty%20SDKs%20that%20your%20app%20links=
%20to." rel=3D"nofollow">ref</a>]</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 id=3D"HandlingPrivacyPolicy-Terminology">Terminology</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<p><code>Privacy Manifest files</code>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>files that describe for your app or third-party SDK:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>the <em><strong>data</strong></em> it collects and</p></li>
<li>
<p>the <em><strong>reasons required APIs</strong></em> it uses.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><code>Required Reason API</code>: the api that access device signals, ne=
eds reason to use to avoid <code>Fingerprinting</code> (use device signals =
to try to identify device / user)</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>including <code>UserDefaults</code></p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><code>Tracking Domains</code>: a list of domains that will be blocked wh=
en user ask app not to track</p></li>
<li>
<p><code>Digital Signature</code>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>required if where the SDKs are used as binary dependencies.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><code>Privacy Report</code></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>a report Xcode 15 generates [<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://=
developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/privacy_manifest_files/de=
scribing_data_use_in_privacy_manifests#4239187" rel=3D"nofollow">steps</a>]=
</p></li>
<li>
<p>it can be used to review our app privacy status</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>check if our SDK is inside</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h2 id=3D"HandlingPrivacyPolicy-Impact">Impact</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<p>App Developer (HKTVmall, HKTV mms=E2=80=A6)</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>ask for Privacy Manifest from SDK author</p></li>
<li>
<p>refer to Xcode <code>Privacy Report</code> before submitting app</p></li=
>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>SDK Developer (ShoalterGroupChat)</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>adopt digital signature and privacy manifest files</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>All Developer</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>complete <code>Tracking Domains</code> list</p></li>
<li>
<p>required reason api</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h2 id=3D"HandlingPrivacyPolicy-Steps">Steps</h2>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Steps for creating<code>Privacy Manifest files</code>:</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>SDK developer:</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://developer.apple.com/documenta=
tion/bundleresources/privacy_manifest_files#4284009" rel=3D"nofollow">for .=
xcframworks</a> (for binary SDK)</p></li>
<li>
<p><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://apnspush.com/add-privacy-mani=
fest-sdk" rel=3D"nofollow">for Cocoapods SDK</a></p></li>
</ol></li>
<li>
<p><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://developer.apple.com/documenta=
tion/bundleresources/privacy_manifest_files#4284009" rel=3D"nofollow">App D=
eveloper</a></p></li>
</ol></li>
<li>
<p>Use Xcode Privacy Report to exam if setting correctly</p></li>
</ol>
<p></p>
<h2 id=3D"HandlingPrivacyPolicy-Discussion">Discussion</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<p>App using old SDK:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Alamofire not going to provide Privacy Manifest files for Alamofire 4 (c=
urrently 5)</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://github.com/Alamofire/Alamofir=
e/pull/3792" rel=3D"nofollow">their reasons</a></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>they doubt apple will ask old dependancies to add privacy manifest</p></=
li>
<li>
<p>only 5 have access <code>Required Reason Api</code>: <code>systemUptime<=
/code></p></li>
<li>
<p>they said if anyone submitting with warning, contact them, they will cla=
rify with Apple</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>SnapKit updated with new version with Privacy Manifest, but not support =
Cocoapod yet. [<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://github.com/SnapKi=
t/SnapKit/issues/786" rel=3D"nofollow">issue</a>]</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://github.com/google/promises/pu=
ll/226#discussion_r1447871477" rel=3D"nofollow">How Google do it</a>, possi=
bly an idea for importing GroupChat to HKTV mms without setting <code>use_f=
rameworks</code></p></li>
</ul>
<h2 id=3D"HandlingPrivacyPolicy-Note:">Note:</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Starts from May 1, 2024, app store connect will reject apps using <code>=
Required Reason APIs</code> without proper <code>Privacy Manifest files</co=
de></p></li>
<li>
<p>SDK developer needs to adopt digital <code>Signature</code>(binary SDK) =
and <code>Privacy Manifest</code></p></li>
</ul>
